WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Still more than half a day

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Where is this still my nearly exclusive villa?

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
This is obviously Pan Sidong

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Liu Qingsi’s rhythm is very steady

5
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Zhao Qian's movement of turning around and flicking her sleeves is also very neat.

6
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
They usually organize military affairs in the company

7
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,500
I was quite energetic during rehearsals.

8
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:20,440
It’s still comfortable to live in a big villa

9
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:21,940
Our boss is really interesting

10
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,940
Yesterday I just took the company into account and made tens of billions of dollars.

11
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,940
This morning I took the big yellow dog to the mountains again to hunt for treasures.

12
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:26,940
Can't even touch the shadow

13
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,440
The boss doesn’t enjoy life

14
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,440
Let's enjoy it for him

15
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:30,940
Party every day at Sky Blue One

16
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:31,940
How comfortable

17
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:32,940
You say

18
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:33,940
If the boss comes back suddenly

19
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:34,940
See how we made the hall look like this

20
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:36,940
Will he cause trouble and fire us all?

21
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:37,940
Fired?

22
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:38,940
You think too much

23
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,940
The boss said it himself at the celebration party yesterday

24
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,440
He is responsible for making money to support the family

25
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:43,940
We are responsible for the beautiful flowers

26
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:45,440
It's too late for him to hurt us

27
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:46,940
How dare you scold us?

28
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:47,940
Ever since I got a million-dollar annual salary
